    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin fuga Israeli ramaseanda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ng'ata ghwaahaak NG'UTAMIIDA geatinga fuga Midiyani gweanyeew ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goombaliischi geatinda fuga Midiyani aba badayda Israeli, nea aba ng'asheega fuga Midiyani gwasissa geat fuga Israeli shoomeanga mida iheenga giijeega, ea gwaleadinga, ea hilooga jea gafuysa geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Iinyo gwahista booga fuga Israeli, inyeesa ghapka fuga Midiyani ea Amaleki ea fuga ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ak gang'uchi sea saawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygooduuw nea gafursiinyi ak gahuuyda haleanjeeda mida jeeda madamnyeanda, ea ghwahita neekiisiinda Gaasa, ak ea moabuuda eara gil aba Israeli, gisilga ghana heeyda ghana digeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gaygoodeanyi sea dugwa nyaawa, ea maheemajeega nyaawa, nea gayghapkaanda deashamga aba seang'ayda nyaawa; saawa ea ngamiyajeega nyaawa manda mooneeda; hean gaweay jeeda ng'eanyiida ghwadatas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goosheala fuga Israeli uurjeenga aba ng'asheega fuga Midiyani; ama ng'ata gooyeawusa fuga Israeli NG'UTAMIIDA nea gagasa weeta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooyeawusa fuga Israeli NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda fuga Midiyani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta NG'UTAMIIDA sibaneeda heeda fuga Israeliin; ama ng'ata gwayeesha, “NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli gwayi: Aniini gearuunaneegwa ng'eanyiida Misri, ak gearuunaneegwa jeeda gheeda soomjeandumeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama ng'ata gealealnaneegwa geatinga fuga ghayi sawaneegwa, ng'ata ghaahoanyi ghang'amwa madeedeang'wa, ng'ata geagoonyeegwa ng'eanyiida nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean geayeenyi ‘Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETEANG'WA; adiidu ghoabwachi aseecheeka Amori, was fuga oamwanyi ng'eanyiida nyaawa.’ Ak agooga ea mooleeysiina iit ghuuteanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA ak goopteada aba guumda sabiida aba Ofra, bea Yoashi was siida Abieseri, damanda aleal ngaano orjeedaanyi siguura Gideoni aba heeda funyaat simuuriisa sabiibu ghafunya fuga Midiyani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu headaanyi malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha, “NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda headaang'u ea siida mwaayi,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Gideoni, “Ea Ng'utamiideanyu, inyas NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda heedeanyu, ghwasaan anda ghwanyaseasa ng'asheesu seaniin, gwanda yeenu ng'asheagaaschi deamdeameadi, ghayi rukuneasa ghweanigaasa, nea gwayeena, ‘Mii NG'UTAMIIDA dea eaneasa hiji nea gooruunaneasa ng'eanyiida Misri?’ Ak ghamneawa ea nijaktaneasa ak ghoahaageasa geatinga Midiyani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayamsa geaw NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha, “Una aba uuri itaang'uuni ak gilealu Israeli aba geatinga Midiyani. Neada ea mii aniini siida ajeaktaneey?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Geamuscheey Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, aniini gaydalealdaaydaan Israeli? Ng'ula dooshteanyu aamwanang' uur aba bugusta eemeeda Manase, ak aniini geawooschi mwanang' aba ghaheanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Aniini gaydandeaweey, ak gaybwarda Midiyani siyagi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha niny, “Ghamneawa ii naanyaschi alooheeda aba madeadaang'u, abeeda giihiimnaani gichea dearoorda danal gideaba siida abaloolan ang'iing'i gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ging'ami hiji geamuscheey, bwak ea doan heeda indi, bwak ea deadu haleanjeeda geatinda, ak ghayiinyi madeadaang'u.” Hean gwayeesha, “Gaydeapteada aba hiji bwak ea biikni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Gideoni jeedeaba gheanyi ak gwajeeng'sheesa niny dayeenda mbooyda, ea mukaatajeega meematawiita bea bakurajeanjagi bea dearanga; ak ghwayiin banyeega jeeda sooscheanda, ak juubanga ghwayiin jeeda dahuuda, hean ng'ata gweadu haleanjeeni headaanyi aba guumda sabiida, ak ghoadaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha malaykajeanda, “Geanda banyeega ea mukaatajeega meematawiita, ak giyiin uhuudeaba lagheaneeni, ama ng'ata giihiisi juubanga uhuudeaba lagheaneani.” Hean ghoadoabiiwdunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinda malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA bileangidideanji mida geatindaanyiin, ak ghawaasa banyeega; ea mukaatajeegiga; ak gwarina beasta jeeda lagheaneeda, ama ng'ata ghwaak banyeegiga ea mukaatajeegiga; ama hit ghabeawa malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwadaa Gideoni gideaba malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA gil: ak gwayi, Gideoni, “Naashageachi Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba gideaba niroonyi gheanyangeasu sea gea NG'UTAMIIDA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Gagasa bea hoyyoo, nea adiidu gibeali; ang'iing'i maymeawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasissa Gideoni heeda wagiida NG'UTAMIIDA aba hoowa ak gaguura gheawungaaschi Yehofa-Shalomu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yehofa Shalomu gideabeadaanyi NG'UTAMIIDA gaba hoyyoo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; eara ghamneawa gudu gwanda hoowa bea Ofra bea eemeeda Abieseri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweedida gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Geanda deeda gweanu, was deedeaba iyeenya bea gweanyeew ispwa, ak ginyarji heeda wagiida bea Baali, mideawa gweanu, ak gilajaadi aseecheeka mida murdeadaanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gideeksi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U heeda wagiida, uhuudeaba lagheaneani, aba lagheanga sijip nea geatoabiiw; ama ng'ata gigeanu heeydeaba iyeenya, ak giidaydi ghoah lukghumajeega sighwarda aba ghweenga aseecheeka ilajaadiin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaloat Gideoni fih damanamughuush aba bugusta fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, ak gwasinda gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba ghoawal fuga gheanyaawa ea fuga mujiini, ea masima askweari, ng'ata gwasin eawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghang'eat ng'eat sakteayda fuga mujiini, ak ging'ulayi, heeda wagiida bea Baali sinyarja, nea aseecheeka mida murdeadaanyi goola eenyarja, nea heedeaba iyeenya ea goola eenuuksa badayda heeda wagiida gudea eesh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobearsiiny, “Gwasin ng'eaha ng'asheanji?” Iing'ata nea niihaak ghaang' nea niibwaarda gwayi, “Ng'asheanji gwasin Gidiyoneeda was orjeeda Yoashi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha fuga mujiini Yoashi, “Aruuni jarooda orjeedang'u eenuusa, aba gideaba gwanyarja heeda wagiida bea Baali ak gabarsa ng'eanyi aseecheeka mida murdeadaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yoashi fuga sean sheang'nyi sea niny, “Ghamneawa ghoayaaji ghuuta Baali? ghana jea aweada agooga? Gilinyoo ghaweat niny gajeenuus sakteayda. Niny ii aseeta gil ghoanung'waadi ghaweat geaw, aba gideaba headaanyi bea wagiida goola eenyarja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eaweedida gaguursa Yerubaali; nea gwayi, “Nung' goobalool Baali niny,” aba gideaba gwanyarja headaanyi bea wagiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghapka hijagi fuga Midiyani ea fuga Amaleki ea fuga gayeew, ak ghoaghaawa Yordani ak gooduuwsa moangoachiyda Yesreeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea guroorooda NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda badayda Gideoni, ng'ata ghaghuut durumbeati, ak geeguursa fuga Abieseri ghwaat geeshtaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta giijasoodiga jeeda Manaseyda sean ak eara saawa ghoamughuush geat ak ghwaat geeshtaanyi. Goojeakta gicha giijasoodiga heeda Asheri, ea Sabuloni, ea Naftali: hean ghang'eat gaweay gwaroonyi saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Gideoni ASEETA, “Inyas gaylealni Israeli aba geatingeasu, gawuurji gidirukuteaydi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ging'ulayi gaydeangoorsa muunda gisilleanda heeda siileeliisa booga, nea inyas gaygwanda rahooda badayda muunda ak ghwahit, nea badayda ng'eanyiida ea ghajaam, abeeda gaydanal gideaba gaylealni Israeli aba geatingeasu, gawuurji gidinyaashti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasa, aba gideaba ghang'eat sakteayda duw ghamwanmwan muunda, gagaw rahooda leabu badaydeaba muundida, ak ghwanyiit gweeriinagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Gideoni ASEETA, “Adiidu ghwayeat nyarastaang'u aba badaydeanyu, nung' dabalool gilinuwaas; geamuscheey, nung' dagala baloolda nibwagi; danung' ghaghajaamiit badayda muunda nea ghwanyas rahooda badayda ng'eanyiisean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasindunu ASEETA eaweedida; aba gideaba ea ghajaam muunda nea badayda ng'eanyiida ghwanyiit rahooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
